--[[c1]] -- Team Shell / Mission 1 -- Code Art plugin shell (owner: Michelangelo).
--[[c2]] -- Runs as the plugin's Script. Child ModuleScripts: Fitter, Lexer (Leonardo),
--[[c3]] -- ImageSource (Donatello, src/image), Equiv + EquivLexer (Raphael), Backup (this folder).
--[[c4]] -- Every write must pass BOTH Fitter.verify (inside transform) and Equiv.check.
--[[c5]] -- Flow: select a script -> enter asset ID -> Preview (exact size from Fitter.predict)
--[[c6]] -- -> Confirm writes via ScriptEditorService:UpdateSourceAsync after Fitter's self-check.
--[[c7]] -- Undo: Studio's undo ignores script Source edits, so every write is preceded by a
--[[c8]] -- persistent backup and a Revert button restores it byte for byte.
--[[c9]] -- Raphael's independent checker (separate lexer)
--[[c10]] -- plugin setting: true once the first-run help has been shown
--[[c11]] -- built-in Studio texture; rbxassetid://0 left the button invisible
--[[c12]] -- UI ----------------------------------------------------------------------
--[[c13]] -- ScrollingFrame so the help section and status fit in a short dock widget.
--[[c14]] -- Hover hints: GuiObjects have no tooltip property, so one shared hint line at the
--[[c15]] -- bottom of the panel shows the text for whatever the mouse is over.
--[[c16]] -- created last (bottom of the panel); tip() only touches it from events
--[[c17]] -- Header + first-run help ---------------------------------------------------
--[[c18]] -- Expanded on first run only. If the setting can't be read, start collapsed (toggle still works).
--[[c19]] -- One-of-N button row. Returns a getter for the current choice.
--[[c20]] -- not via add(): Frame has no Font/Text properties
--[[c21]] -- Filler character (Leonardo: "#" default; only glyphs verified in Studio's editor)
--[[c22]] -- Detail mode (Donatello's ImageSource: silhouette = 2-class Otsu, features = middle band of 3-class Otsu)
--[[c23]] -- room for the size line, Features note and image warnings
--[[c24]] -- State -------------------------------------------------------------------
--[[c25]] -- Preview (criterion 1) -----------------------------------------------------
--[[c26]] -- ID validation is ImageSource's job (one parser for the whole plugin); show its message verbatim.
--[[c27]] -- ImageSource messages are complete sentences; show verbatim
--[[c28]] -- Features needs >= FEATURES_MIN_COLS for eyes/mouth to survive (Raphael's facehole
--[[c29]] -- test: real decal fails at 24, passes from 32). Widen unless the code then won't fit.
--[[c30]] -- Image-quality warnings from ImageSource (low contrast, small ink, ...), shown verbatim.
--[[c31]] -- Transform ---------------------------------------------------------------
--[[c32]] -- the script was edited after Preview; cancel rather than overwrite
--[[c33]] -- Revert (replaces Studio undo, criterion 7 as amended) -------------------
